{"id":21046,"name":"芳华待灼","rarity":4,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"晨光熹微，寂静的花林中，腾挪移转的身影惊起只只飞鸟。\\n\\n默念剑招，随势舞动，原本生涩的招式越发纯熟。剑气所至之处，落花如雨，纷乱空中。不知不觉间，清凉的云雾已湿了她的鬓发。\\n\\n<i> 「好剑法！」 </i>\\n她惊觉，顺势转动手中的剑——\\n背后，灰发的{F#少女}{M#少年}放下了手中的相机。\\n<i> 「美好的记忆可不会随风而逝。」 </i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21046,"name":"莫失莫忘","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。进入战斗时，若有两名及以上我方角色拥有任意相同命途，使这些角色的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。同类技能无法重复生效。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.16,0.16]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.2,0.2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.24]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.28,0.28]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.32,0.32]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":19.2,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":114001,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":42.24,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114001,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":72.96,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114002,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":103.68,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":114002,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":134.4,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110233,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114003,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":371.52,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":165.12,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":154.8,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":70,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":160000},{